<section footer="0" header="1" xid="5" props="page-margin-footer:0.5in; page-margin-header:0.5in">
<p style="Normal" xid="6" props="text-align:center"><c props="font-weight:bold">MOUNTAINS OF THE MOON UNIVERSITY</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="7" props="text-align:center"><c props="font-weight:bold">INDIVIDUAL COURSEWORK</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="8" props="text-align:center"><c props="font-weight:bold">BUSINESS COMMUNICATION AND REPORT WRITING</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="11" props="text-align:center"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="12" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">It was a Wednesday evening, the 7th of September when i visited Great lakes hospital located at Kahungabunyonyi opposite Kahungabunyonyi Primary School next to FINS Medical unversity where i met the radiology officer, Mr. Byamukama Sarapius. i introduced myself as na student of computer science Mountains of the moon university. </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="13" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">I asked him about the kinds of reports he generates and he told me the following:</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="14" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">&gt;The gynaecology ultrasound scan report</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="15" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">&gt;General medical report</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="16" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">&gt;radiography equipment maintenance report</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="17" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="18" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal">And this is a picture of me and Mr. Byamukama Sarapius</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="19" props="text-align:left"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
</section>
<section id="1" listid="0" parentid="0" type="header" xid="3">
<p xid="4" props="text-align:left"></p>
